GNU Radio source examples
========================

read_samples.grc is a GNU Radio Companion receive flowgraph using the native
CaribouLite source. Install the module with Python/GRC support before opening
it; see ../README.md. Review its channel, frequency, sample rate and connected
outputs for your setup before running it.

cariboulite_source_test/ contains generated C++ source and a separate CMake
project. Unlike the module's GNU Radio 3.10 minimum, this example requests
GNU Radio 3.11 and many components. It is not built by the parent module's
CMakeLists.txt. Do not assume it builds unchanged with a GNU Radio 3.10 package.

Neither example is a recorded end-to-end RX qualification, and there is no
native TX flowgraph/sink in this module.
